Step 5 – Application validation
I coordinate with the application team to validate the application.
Step 6 – Production cutover
If required, I update the application configuration/DNS/endpoint and perform the controlled cutover.
Common challenges
The common challenges can include:
Restore taking longer than expected.
Incorrect security-group configuration.
Application unable to connect.
DNS/endpoint changes.
Database version compatibility.
Insufficient storage.
Missing parameter configurations.
Differences between source and restored environments.
I always recommend periodic restore testing, because having a backup is not enough; we need to verify that the backup can actually be restored successfully.
